    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46223" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζήλ-ωσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>emulation, imitation</i>, 
